                                "sense_id": "85509a76-a418-3d7d-aa5e-6d9304662929",
                                "text": "Dr Esterson's next book, The Leaves of Spring - a Study in the Dialectics of Madness, is an illuminating idiographic study, devoted for the major part to the painstaking, detailed study of a patient and her family, investigated and treated as the interacting elements of a unity."
